sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant E as Extension
participant A as API server
participant Q as Redis
participant W as Celery worker
participant M as Image models
Note over A,Q: ImageProcessor runs for each post image
A->>M: get_best_filter()
M-->>A: best filter, top 3 interventions
A->>Q: enqueue workflow task
A-->>E: feed HTML, image marked DEFERRED
Note over E,A: spinner shown on the image
Q->>W: deliver task
W->>Q: cache check
W->>M: apply each candidate
M-->>W: transformed images
W->>M: score each candidate
M-->>W: scores
W->>Q: cache best result
loop poll, at most 20 attempts
  E->>A: GET /get_img_result
  A->>Q: read image cache
  A-->>E: NOT FOUND or COMPLETED + URL
end
Note over E,A: image replaced, indicator added
